  "document": "For Adults Only\nFor Adults Only (1971) is the 13th comedy album by Bill Cosby. It was recorded at the Westgate Las Vegas Resort & Casino, then known as the International Hotel. The title \"For Adults Only\" was also used for a 1959 Pearl Bailey LP (Roulette R-25016)."
